ProjectID) covers the resource scope (which does not), never the reverse; principals whose only access is a scoped grant must use a parent-scoped route to address a service-scoped variable list. A cross-tenant or unknown service_id reaches the persistence layer with the principal's home organization id and is rejected as a deterministic 404 by the reader's service existence check, never disguised as an empty success. A service with no variables is a deterministic empty list.",
